{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-page","disabled":true,"settings":{"padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"advanced_slider":{"type":"advanced-slider","blocks":{"slide_1":{"type":"slide","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/boba_drinks.jpg","heading":"Your Café Moment, Made at Home.","caption":"From the makers of The Tea Planet, we bring you the joy of bubble tea. Easy, Fun, and Full of flavor.","button_label":"","link":"","button_style_secondary":false,"apply_link_to_image":true}},"slide_2":{"type":"slide","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/BlueHawai_Making_Step_Enjoy.jpg","heading":"Good Taste. Good Planet.","caption":"Eco-conscious cups, paper straws, and recyclable packaging — because the best bubble tea experience shouldn’t cost the earth.","button_label":"","link":"","button_style_secondary":false,"apply_link_to_image":false}},"slide_cTpR43":{"type":"slide","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Classic_Matcha_op2.jpg","heading":"Made by Experts, Loved by All.","caption":"Every BTS kit is powered by The Tea Planet — trusted for over a decade to deliver world-class flavor and café-quality tea experiences.","button_label":"","link":"","button_style_secondary":false,"apply_link_to_image":false}}},"block_order":["slide_1","slide_2","slide_cTpR43"],"settings":{"auto_rotate":true,"slider_direction":"horizontal","slider_loop":true,"slider_interval":5,"slider_height":50,"full_width":false,"hide_slider_desktop":false,"hide_slider_mobile":false,"content_height":140,"content_position":3,"content_size":40,"content_align":"left","content_box":true,"content_opacity":0.7,"heading_size":3.2,"heading_tag":"h2","heading_style":"none","caption_size":1.5,"caption_style":"none","color_scheme":"","color_scheme_1":"option-2","mobile_heading_size":2.2,"mobile_caption_size":1.4,"margin_spacing":"negative","margin_top":0,"mobile_height":40,"mobile_content_height":20,"mobile_content_size":70,"padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0,"ignore_spacing":false}},"rich_text":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"heading":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"<p>We Make Bubble Tea Easy, Fun & Flavorful.<\/p>","heading_size":"large","heading_style":"default","heading_tag":"h2","highlight_option":"underline-hand","word_animation_color":"#d4c4d9"}},"caption_ynXRkC":{"type":"caption","settings":{"caption":"Good taste shouldn’t wait, or cost a fortune.","text_style":"caption-with-letter-spacing","text_size":"medium"}},"text":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>At <strong>The Bubble Tea Store (BTS)<\/strong>, we started with one simple idea — bubble tea shouldn’t be a luxury. Why spend ₹300 or more for one cup when you can make four at home for less?<\/p><p>Our goal was to make <strong>authentic café-style boba accessible to everyone<\/strong> — from cozy evenings to birthday parties and college hangouts. With our <strong>DIY Bubble Tea Kits<\/strong>, you can shake up real, café-quality bubble tea anytime — fresh, fun, and ready in just two minutes.<\/p><p>Backed by <strong>The Tea Planet’s<\/strong> expertise, each kit uses the same high-quality ingredients trusted by cafés across the world — now reimagined for your home.<\/p><p>This is just the beginning. From <strong>Bubblegum to Thai<\/strong>, we’re on a mission to make bubble tea affordable, creative, and shareable for all.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["heading","caption_ynXRkC","text"],"settings":{"desktop_content_position":"center","content_alignment":"center","full_width":false,"color_scheme":"option-1","padding_top":32,"padding_bottom":16,"ignore_spacing":true,"margin_spacing":"negative","margin_top":0,"mobile_content_alignment":"left"}},"image_with_text_hVbygN":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_6NFbyN":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Born from Passion, Blended with Purpose.","heading_size":"large","heading_style":"default","heading_tag":"h2"}},"text_G3hbWA":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Our journey began with a single idea — to make bubble tea accessible, affordable, and truly enjoyable. From sourcing high-quality tea leaves to crafting perfectly balanced flavors, every detail in our kits is made with love and precision.<\/p><p>We don’t just follow trends, we build experiences that let you <strong>create café-quality bubble tea, right in your kitchen.<\/strong><\/p>","text_style":"body"}},"button_zqRgrw":{"type":"button","disabled":true,"settings":{"button_label":"Button Label","button_link":"","button_style_secondary":false}}},"block_order":["heading_6NFbyN","text_G3hbWA","button_zqRgrw"],"disabled":true,"name":"t:sections.image-with-text.presets.name","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/about_BTS.jpg","caption":"From cravings to a mission","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","desktop_content_position":"middle","desktop_content_alignment":"left","full_width":true,"color_scheme":"","padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0,"ignore_spacing":false,"margin_spacing":"negative","margin_top":0,"mobile_content_alignment":"left"}},"two_images_text":{"type":"two-images-text","blocks":{"caption":{"type":"caption","disabled":true,"settings":{"caption":"Subheading","text_style":"caption-with-letter-spacing","text_size":"medium"}},"heading":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Born from Passion, Blended with Purpose.","heading_size":"medium","heading_style":"default","heading_tag":"h2"}},"text":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Our journey began with a single idea: to make bubble tea accessible, affordable, and truly enjoyable. From sourcing high-quality tea leaves to crafting perfectly balanced flavors, every detail in our kits is made with love and precision.<\/p><p>We don’t just follow trends, we build experiences that let you <strong>create café-quality bubble tea, right in your kitchen.<\/strong><\/p>"}},"button":{"type":"button","disabled":true,"settings":{"button_label":"Explore Kits","button_link":"shopify:\/\/collections\/all"}}},"block_order":["caption","heading","text","button"],"disabled":tr